---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="AI Visibility Fix Pack — Done-For-You GEO Fixes, $49 One-Time | GeoScore"
  description="We rebuild your llms.txt from your real catalog, write explicit AI-crawler rules for robots.txt, and complete Product schema for your best-seller — then re-audit after you deploy. $49 one-time, 48-hour delivery."
  schema={{
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: [
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'What does the Fix Pack include?',
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'A custom llms.txt built from your sitemap and product catalog (not a template), a robots.txt snippet that explicitly welcomes GPTBot, ClaudeBot and PerplexityBot without touching your existing rules, completed Product JSON-LD for one best-selling product, a 1-page audit summary, and a re-audit with before/after scores once you have deployed the files.' }
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'How is this different from the free fix file generator?',
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'The free generator produces a generic skeleton from your homepage title and description. The Fix Pack is built by a human from your actual catalog and pages, checked against your live robots.txt and schema, and verified with a re-audit after deployment. You are paying for the catalog work, the checking, and the verification — not for three files any chatbot can draft.' }
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'Do you guarantee rankings or AI citations?',
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'No — and no honest provider can. AI answers depend on the engines, your content, and your market. What we guarantee is the deliverable: correct, catalog-specific files, deployed-ready, plus a re-audit showing exactly what changed in your 11-dimension score.' }
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'How do I order and pay?',
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Message us your store URL on Fiverr first and get a free 1-paragraph diagnosis. If the diagnosis shows real gaps, order the Fix Pack as a $49 Custom Offer on the same Fiverr gig — payment stays in Fiverr escrow until you accept the delivery.' }
      },
      {
        '@type': 'Question',
        name: 'What do you need from me?',
        acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: 'Just your store URL and which product sells best. No admin access, no passwords. You (or your developer) paste the files in — we include install notes for Shopify and plain-HTML sites — and tell us when they are live so we can run the re-audit.' }
      }
    ]
  }}>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/20 mb-4">
        Done for you · One-time payment
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mb-4 tracking-tight">
        AI Visibility <span class="gradient-text">Fix Pack</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Your store's AI files, rebuilt from your real catalog by the developer of GeoScore —
        and re-audited after you deploy. <span class="text-white font-semibold">$49 one-time · 48-hour delivery.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The problem, with receipts -->
    <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Why most stores are invisible to AI search</h2>
      <div class="text-sm text-gray-400 space-y-3">
        <p>
          When a shopper asks ChatGPT or Perplexity for a product, the engine can only use what its crawlers
          can read. We checked 20 well-known direct-to-consumer stores on 2026-10-23: every <span class="font-mono text-gray-300">llms.txt</span>
          we found was either Shopify's stock template with <strong class="text-gray-200">zero product facts</strong>,
          a 65-byte broken file, or missing entirely (404). Their <span class="font-mono text-gray-300">robots.txt</span> files
          never mentioned GPTBot, ClaudeBot or PerplexityBot at all.
        </p>
        <p>
          An independent 2026 study of 216 Shopify stores (Visibility Mesh) put the median AI visibility at
          <strong class="text-gray-200">46/100</strong>, with only 13% of stores fully legible to AI crawlers.
          In our own audit of 343 websites, all 18 sites scoring above 72 had a real llms.txt — the template
          version does not get you there.
        </p>
        <p>
          Run the <a href="/" class="text-brand-400 hover:underline">free GeoScore audit</a> on your store first.
          If your AI Guidance, crawler access or structured data dimensions are weak, this pack fixes exactly those files.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Deliverables -->
    <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">What you get</h2>
      <ul class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-3">
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500">✓</span><span><strong class="text-white">Custom llms.txt built from your catalog</strong> — your categories, best-sellers and key pages, written from your sitemap and product data. Not the stock template, not a homepage skeleton.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500">✓</span><span><strong class="text-white">robots.txt AI-crawler snippet</strong> — explicit rules welcoming GPTBot, ClaudeBot and PerplexityBot, merged so your existing rules stay exactly as they are.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500">✓</span><span><strong class="text-white">Product JSON-LD for 1 best-seller</strong> — name, offers, price, availability and identifiers completed and validated, so AI engines stop dropping the product for malformed schema.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500">✓</span><span><strong class="text-white">1-page audit summary</strong> — your 11-dimension scores and the exact gaps the files address, in plain language.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500">✓</span><span><strong class="text-white">Post-deploy re-audit</strong> — once the files are live, we re-run the audit and send before/after scores. If a file was pasted wrong, you see it here, not months later.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
        Need more products or sitewide schema? The extended pack ($129) covers up to 10 products — ask in the same Fiverr thread.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <div class="card p-6 md:p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="text-sm text-gray-300 space-y-3 list-none">
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-brand-400">1.</span><span><strong class="text-white">Free diagnosis first.</strong> Message your store URL via the Fiverr gig below. You get a 1-paragraph diagnosis of what AI crawlers actually see — free, no obligation.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-brand-400">2.</span><span><strong class="text-white">Order the $49 Custom Offer.</strong> Payment stays in Fiverr escrow. No admin access or passwords are ever requested.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-brand-400">3.</span><span><strong class="text-white">Delivery within 48 hours.</strong> Files plus install notes for Shopify or plain HTML.</span></li>
        <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-brand-400">4.</span><span><strong class="text-white">You deploy, we re-audit.</strong> Paste the files (or hand them to your developer), tell us they're live, and receive your before/after re-audit.</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
        <a id="fixpack-fiverr-cta" href="https://www.fiverr.com/chinesefood885/audit-your-website-for-ai-search-visibility-and-implement-geo-fixes" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="flex-1 text-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-geo-600 to-brand-600 hover:from-geo-500 hover:to-brand-500 transition">
          Get the free diagnosis on Fiverr →
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:qq136692547@gmail.com?subject=Fix%20Pack%20—%20my%20store%20URL" class="flex-1 text-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm border border-gray-600 text-gray-300 hover:border-brand-500 hover:text-white transition">
          Or email your store URL
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3 text-center">Built and delivered by Deng Li, developer of GeoScore — the same engine that scores this site 94/100.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ (must stay in sync with the FAQPage schema above) -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-6">Fix Pack FAQ</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">What does the Fix Pack include?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">A custom llms.txt built from your sitemap and product catalog (not a template), a robots.txt snippet that explicitly welcomes GPTBot, ClaudeBot and PerplexityBot without touching your existing rules, completed Product JSON-LD for one best-selling product, a 1-page audit summary, and a re-audit with before/after scores once you have deployed the files.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">How is this different from the free fix file generator?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">The free generator produces a generic skeleton from your homepage title and description. The Fix Pack is built by a human from your actual catalog and pages, checked against your live robots.txt and schema, and verified with a re-audit after deployment. You are paying for the catalog work, the checking, and the verification — not for three files any chatbot can draft.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Do you guarantee rankings or AI citations?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">No — and no honest provider can. AI answers depend on the engines, your content, and your market. What we guarantee is the deliverable: correct, catalog-specific files, deployed-ready, plus a re-audit showing exactly what changed in your 11-dimension score.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">How do I order and pay?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Message us your store URL on Fiverr first and get a free 1-paragraph diagnosis. If the diagnosis shows real gaps, order the Fix Pack as a $49 Custom Offer on the same Fiverr gig — payment stays in Fiverr escrow until you accept the delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card p-5">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">What do you need from me?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Just your store URL and which product sells best. No admin access, no passwords. You (or your developer) paste the files in — we include install notes for Shopify and plain-HTML sites — and tell us when they are live so we can run the re-audit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Service',
    name: 'AI Visibility Fix Pack',
    serviceType: 'GEO (Generative Engine Optimization) remediation',
    provider: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'GeoScore', url: 'https://geoscore.help' },
    description: 'Done-for-you GEO fix package: custom llms.txt built from your catalog, AI-crawler robots.txt rules, Product JSON-LD completion, a 1-page audit, and a post-deploy re-audit.',
    offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '49', priceCurrency: 'USD', name: 'AI Visibility Fix Pack (one-time)', availability: 'https://schema.org/InStock', url: 'https://geoscore.help/fixpack/' }
  })} />
</Layout>

<script>
  if (window.geoTrack) {
    window.geoTrack('fixpack_viewed', { source_type: window.geoSource ? window.geoSource() : 'other' });
  }
  var cta = document.getElementById('fixpack-fiverr-cta');
  if (cta) {
    cta.addEventListener('click', function () {
      if (window.geoTrack) window.geoTrack('fixpack_cta_clicked', { placement: 'fixpack_page', transport_type: 'beacon' });
    });
  }
</script>
